          objective: 'Have the highest cumulative score after all rounds (Negative + Positive) are completed.',
          gameplay: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, play any card (in negative rounds) or trump (in positive rounds).\n2. Scoring varies by house; common penalty is -5 for hearts, -20 for queens, etc.',
          keyRules: [
            'Negative rounds: avoid winning specific tricks or cards',
            'Positive rounds: try to win tricks',
            'Each round has different scoring objectives',
            'King of Hearts (Barbu) is the most critical card',
